- Fixed the constant-shadowing defect: constants declare their own program-scope binding (`src/lsp.rs:528`), and the deferred pass no longer rewrites already-resolved uses (`src/lsp.rs:1511`). Added `edge_constant_after_a_same_named_set_is_its_own_binding`.
- The import finding did not reproduce: the analyzer and runtime bind both the module name and alias, pinned by existing runtime tests. Added `edge_import_alias_keeps_the_modules_own_name_a_binding` to cover navigation instead of changing correct behavior.
- Updated `phases/phase-075/REPORT.md`.
